# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:12
translate italian brandichat13_12a15b04:

    # "I wonder if Brandi is streaming right now. I open up the Kitch website and see her stream on the front page."
    "Mi chiedo se Brandi stia trasmettendo in diretta proprio ora. Apro il sito di Kitch e vedo la sua diretta in prima pagina."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:16
translate italian brandichat13_10721f64:

    # "She's already in the middle of a conversation when I load up the stream."
    "È già nel bel mezzo di una conversazione quando carico la diretta."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:17
translate italian brandichat13_043da28e:

    # fd "Yeah, I know... tacos again."
    fd "Sì, lo so... ancora i tacos."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:18
translate italian brandichat13_50219991:

    # fd "Sorry there's nothing original here. Tacos are just so easy to cook and I love them."
    fd "Scusate, non c’è nulla di originale qui. I tacos sono così facili da preparare e li adoro."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:19
translate italian brandichat13_59d187b9:

    # fd "There's a few foods that I could eat practically every day. Tacos are one of them."
    fd "Ci sono pochi cibi che potrei mangiare praticamente ogni giorno. I tacos sono uno di questi."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:22
translate italian brandichat13_cd191cde:

    # fd "Seriously, they're like... the perfect food."
    fd "Sul serio, sono tipo... il cibo perfetto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:23
translate italian brandichat13_60855393:

    # fd "I'm just going to eat all of them and not even talk for a while."
    fd "Me li mangerò tutti e non parlerò nemmeno per un po’."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:24
translate italian brandichat13_4646adf9:

    # fd "Y'all just keep yourself occupied while I devour these things."
    fd "Voi tenetevi occupati mentre io divoro queste cose."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:27
translate italian brandichat13_2a0e71d7:

    # fd "Wait, what the heck are y'all talking about in here?"
    fd "Aspettate, ma di che diavolo state parlando qui dentro?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:28
translate italian brandichat13_28107cf9:

    # fd "Oh gods, some dumb man is on here talking about how bad I am because I earn money doing something that he can't?"
    fd "Oh mio Dio, c'è un idiota qui che mi sta criticando perché guadagno soldi facendo qualcosa che lui non è in grado di fare?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:29
translate italian brandichat13_7872eeb2:

    # fd "Look, I'm not going to apologize for looking good and making money by looking good."
    fd "Senti, non ho intenzione di scusarmi per essere bella e per guadagnare grazie al mio aspetto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:30
translate italian brandichat13_dbe26ec2:

    # fd "It's my body, and I can make money off of it. You'd rather I go work a factory job or something, wearing my body out so that somebody else can make money off of me?"
    fd "È il mio corpo, e posso trarne profitto. Preferiresti che andassi a lavorare in una fabbrica o qualcosa del genere, logorandomi fisicamente affinché qualcun altro possa guadagnare alle mie spalle?"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:31
translate italian brandichat13_75444af1:

    # fd "You can go fuck yourself, you misogynist prick."
    fd "Vai a farti fottere, coglione misogino."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:32
translate italian brandichat13_b8abfd29:

    # fd "I come on here almost every night, talk to people, maybe share some food tips or restaurant reviews, and make people happy."
    fd "Vengo qui quasi ogni sera, parlo con la gente, magari condivido qualche consiglio culinario o recensioni di ristoranti, e rendo felici le persone."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:33
translate italian brandichat13_c39541a9:

    # fd "That's the big thing - what I do makes people happy."
    fd "È questa la cosa importante: quello che faccio rende felici le persone."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:34
translate italian brandichat13_ed1fb37f:

    # fd "And you want me to stop because you're mad that you can't do it."
    fd "E tu vuoi che smetta perché sei arrabbiato perché tu non sei in grado di farlo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:35
translate italian brandichat13_07eb1662:

    # fd "You're mad that I'm making money by doing something fun and just being me, and you can't do that because you're a miserable jerk."
    fd "Sei arrabbiata perché io guadagno facendo qualcosa di divertente ed essendo semplicemente me stessa, e tu non puoi farlo perché sei una miserabile idiota."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:36
translate italian brandichat13_1f8b563e:

    # fd "It doesn't have anything to do with you being a man. There are plenty of men who make a lot of money on the internet. YouTube and Twitch are full of them."
    fd "Non ha nulla a che vedere con il fatto che tu sia un uomo. Ci sono tantissimi uomini che guadagnano un sacco di soldi su Internet. YouTube e Twitch ne sono pieni."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:37
translate italian brandichat13_1f911e81:

    # fd "You think they work any harder than I do? They don't even have to stay in shape!"
    fd "Pensi che lavorino più duramente di me? Non devono nemmeno tenersi in forma!"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:38
translate italian brandichat13_e7198da9:

    # fd "And they don't have to put up with men coming to their stream calling them sluts because they dared to show a couple inches of cleavage."
    fd "E non devono sopportare che degli uomini entrino nelle loro dirette chiamandole troie solo perché hanno osato mostrare un paio di pollici di scollatura."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:42
translate italian brandichat13_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/brandichat 13_1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandichat 13_1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:43
translate italian brandichat13_4b8c65e7:

    # fd "They're just boobs, you fucking loser."
    fd "Sono solo tette, fottuto perdente."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:45
translate italian brandichat13_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/brandichat 13_2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandichat 13_2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:46
translate italian brandichat13_01413bd9:

    # fd "Half the world has them. Your mom has them."
    fd "Metà del mondo le ha. Tua madre le ha."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:47
translate italian brandichat13_b27d7d88:

    # fd "That's not the point though."
    fd "Ma non è questo il punto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:48
translate italian brandichat13_211e3b47:

    # fd "Even if I was a slut. Even if I popped my tits out right here for the views, that has nothing to do with you."
    fd "Anche se fossi una troia. Anche se tirassi fuori le tette proprio qui per le visualizzazioni, questo non ha nulla a che vedere con te."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:50
translate italian brandichat13_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/brandichat 13_3.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandichat 13_3.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:51
translate italian brandichat13_38107e93:

    # fd "If you don't like it, leave. But you don't get to decide what I do with my body. Only I do."
    fd "Se non ti piace, vattene. Ma non spetta a te decidere cosa faccio del mio corpo. Solo a me."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:52
translate italian brandichat13_96e8fa0b:

    # fd "If I want to use my body to make people happy and make some money for myself, then I will."
    fd "Se voglio usare il mio corpo per rendere felici le persone e guadagnare un po’ di soldi per me stessa, lo farò."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:53
translate italian brandichat13_28886f1d:

    # fd "There's nothing wrong with that."
    fd "Non c’è niente di male in questo."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:55
translate italian brandichat13_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice 'voices/brandichat 13_4.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandichat 13_4.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:56
translate italian brandichat13_05cbbe5c:

    # fd "Anyway! Die mad. I'm banning you now."
    fd "Comunque! Muori arrabbiato. Ti banno subito."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:59
translate italian brandichat13_60e04445:

    # fd "Hey guys, I'm sorry for going off like that. Some people just push my buttons sometimes."
    fd "Ehi ragazzi, mi dispiace di essermi lasciata andare così. Alcune persone a volte mi fanno proprio perdere le staffe."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:60
translate italian brandichat13_1b80e2dc:

    # fd "Thanks for all the love though. I know not all of you are like that."
    fd "Grazie comunque per tutto il vostro affetto. So che non siete tutti così."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:61
translate italian brandichat13_7c74586d:

    # fd "And, [pcname]! Hey, I didn't see you there at first! Thanks for popping in."
    fd "E, [pcname]! Ehi, all'inizio non ti avevo visto! Grazie per essere passato."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:62
translate italian brandichat13_641205bb:

    # fd "I just want to say, support the people that you like, and ignore the ones you don't."
    fd "Voglio solo dire: sostenete le persone che vi piacciono e ignorate quelle che non vi piacciono."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:63
translate italian brandichat13_b51a507a:

    # fd "And if other people are having fun doing something that you don't like, and they're not hurting anybody, just shut up about it and mind your own business."
    fd "E se gli altri si divertono a fare qualcosa che a voi non piace, e non fanno del male a nessuno, state zitti e fatevi gli affari vostri."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:64
translate italian brandichat13_8bc6e094:

    # fd "Alright, that's it. I'll step down from my soapbox now. It's about time for bed anyway."
    fd "Va bene, basta così. Ora scendo dal mio pulpito. È comunque ora di andare a letto."

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:65
translate italian brandichat13_ef10a2a5:

    # fd "I hope you all have a great night. I love ya!"
    fd "Spero che passiate tutti una splendida serata. Vi voglio bene!"

# game/Scenes/Brandi/brandichat13.rpy:67
translate italian brandichat13_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice 'voices/brandi_seeya2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/brandi_seeya2.mp3'

